Hấp thụ San Hô đầu tiên tăng Máu tối đa của chủ sở hữu thêm @TFTUnitProperty.item:TFTEvent5YR_Empress_FirstCoralHealthPercentageIncrease@% và trao @TFTUnitProperty.item:TFTEvent5YR_Empress_FirstCoralADIncrease@%  và @TFTUnitProperty.item:TFTEvent5YR_Empress_FirstCoralAPIncrease@% .

@TFTUnitProperty.item:TFTEvent5YR_Empress_PrismaticItemTooltipFooter@

Lavender Crown.desc_en:
When the holder consumes a Void Coral, they blink to its location and deal @TFTTrait.TFTEvent5YR_Empress.1:PercentADDamage*100@%  + @TFTTrait.TFTEvent5YR_Empress.1:PercentAPDamage*100@%  magic damage to enemies within @TFTTrait.TFTEvent5YR_Empress.1:HexRange@ hexes.

Consuming the first Coral increases the holder's max Health by @TFTUnitProperty.item:TFTEvent5YR_Empress_FirstCoralHealthPercentageIncrease@% and grants @TFTUnitProperty.item:TFTEvent5YR_Empress_FirstCoralADIncrease@%  and @TFTUnitProperty.item:TFTEvent5YR_Empress_FirstCoralAPIncrease@% .

@TFTUnitProperty.item:TFTEvent5YR_Empress_PrismaticItemTooltipFooter@

